WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.841
Every few months, coders, designers and dreamers across Canada come together for one weekend!

00:00:06.141 --> 00:00:11.887
Forty-eight hours. Real problems from churches, charities and communities. Real code that ships.

00:00:12.187 --> 00:00:13.477
Code in service of the mission!

00:00:13.777 --> 00:00:18.180
This is HackMission. Get on the list, and you will hear the moment the next one opens.
